sn35.117:2.4 | P: yattha jivhā ca nirujjhati, rasasaññā ca nirujjhati, se āyatane veditabbe …pe… | T: where the tongue ceases and the perception of flavor fades… where the body ceases and the perception of tactile sensation fades…
